# Rival frontend — DEVELOPMENT (used by `next dev`).
# Committed on purpose: no secrets here. NEXT_PUBLIC_* is exposed to the browser.
#
# Talk to the local API. This value also drives the CSP `connect-src` and
# `img-src` in src/middleware.ts, so the app can reach nothing else.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
